flowchart LR
  Browser[Browser: image or video] -->|Sample at most 12 frames, no original video upload| API
  REST[REST client] -->|Organization API key| API
  MCP[MCP client] -->|Same API key, Streamable HTTP| API
  ALB[ALB: HTTPS, API and MCP routing] --> API[Next.js API on ECS Fargate]
  API --> CV[OpenCV 5: decode, resize, grayscale, difference, threshold, thumbnail]
  CV --> YOLOX[OpenCV 5 DNN: YOLOX COCO-80 detection, checksum-pinned OpenCV Zoo model]
  API -->|Optional first, middle, last sampled frames| Nova[Amazon Bedrock Nova Lite]
  Nova -->|Advisory summary and package boxes| API
  API --> DDB[DynamoDB: tenant job history, thumbnail, usage, public daily budget]
  API --> Result[Structured result, timestamps, measured motion and labeled boxes]
  Result --> Browser
  Result --> REST
  Result --> MCP
